'''Castle of the Sentinels''' (立ちはだかる者達の城 ''Tachihadakaru-sha-tachi no Shiro'', '''Castle of Obstructionists''') is the 37th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 86th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. Its stages consist of only a few major enemies, without any peons.

==Difficulty==
Half of these stages are a gimmick; knowing that can save a lot of trouble.
{{LegendDiff|130|160|100}}

